globs: website/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# website/

- Keep `index.html` as the shell. Add behavior in existing modules (`tests.js`, `shop.js`, `specialists.js`, `spectit-booking.js`).
- Shop checkout must be an enquiry form. Button copy: "Request this order", never "Complete Purchase".
- Product images use `SpectitProductImages` (SVG data URIs). Do not use via.placeholder.com.
- Provider UI lives in `provider.html`. Patient booking lives in `spectit-booking.js`.
- Specialist search must work without GPS or Google Places via the curated SA directory. Booking times are requests, not a live diary.
- After UI changes, verify the flow in the browser (not a single screenshot).
